### C.jet_secp_curve_group_power.secp_group_power_pos_correct
secp_group_power_pos_correct
     : forall (point : jet_secp_curve_group_sign.secp_group_point) (k : BinNums.positive),
       @eq jet_secp_curve_group_sign.secp_group_point (secp_group_power_pos point k)
         (@EGroup.gpow jet_secp_curve_group_sign.secp_group_point
